WEBVTT

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:17.020
Go to Hujin

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:17.020
*Later Jin Dynasty

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:20.310
Episode 12

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:21.480
Find out how strong they are

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:25.020
But this... is very dangerous

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:27.660
I'll do as you order

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:39.210
Project coordinator, editor and translator of songs: Nemie

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.670
Aren't you going to argue?

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:35.600
This is your order, how can I?

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:39.970
I will leave Songak as you ordered

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:49.310
Translators: Nemie, Kaia

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:45.620
But Hae Soo has nowhere to go but Damiwon

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:49.260
Please be understanding about this

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:59.410
Beta Editor: Sana

00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:52.370
Do you still take her side?

00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:56.280
I can't refuse her

00:00:58.470 --> 00:01:01.860
I will work hard as Ambassador to Hujin

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:09.510
Typesetters: Nemie, Sana

00:01:26.450 --> 00:01:28.090
Get rid of Hae Soo

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:30.670
What?

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:33.550
Send her to a place where she can't see the princes

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:39.590
If he can't refuse it,
then his father will help him

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:53.810
Her dignity was comparable to that of an empress

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:57.970
But she was not born under the empress's star

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:02.430
Is this good or bad?

00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:10.490
I'm asking the obvious questions

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.770
She left this place after she met me

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:18.370
It's bad luck

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:21.320
She left without resentment or bitterness

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:23.040
So it's lucky for her

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:26.340
Believe it

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:31.780
You must leave Damiwon

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:38.070
You are ordered not to say goodbye to the princes,
from now on you won't see them

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:44.890
Where will I go?

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:51.340
Where am I ordered to go?
where I won’t be able to see the princes?

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:32.310
How are you feeling?

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:39.320
No matter how much my heart hurts
life doesn't stop moving

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:42.720
I think if I watch this active move,

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:46.430
then one day I can forget everything

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:48.780
Forget everything quickly

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:52.450
To forget such difficulties,
you'll have to try

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.240
You too, Your Highness

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:01.010
Please forget me

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:14.550
Don't say that

00:04:14.550 --> 00:04:18.140
Stay in Damiwon and wait for my return

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:32.740
I won't wait

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:37.050
This happened because you tried to help me

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:42.190
I remember how happy you became
when they settled in the palace

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:47.090
You don't want to leave, but you have to

00:04:48.710 --> 00:04:50.230
It's all because of me

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:57.320
Please... learn to distinguish friendship from love

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:01.830
If you give all your love to one person,

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:04.130
it will be difficult for you

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:08.850
It's you who might face bad luck if you contact me

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:11.610
This happens to everyone

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.180
I still won't let you go

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:28.770
Because with a face like that...
all people do is curse him

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:41.440
Stupid

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:44.130
I said I wanted your permission

00:05:57.950 --> 00:05:59.210
I lied

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:06.040
I'll take it for luck

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:08.730
I'll be back soon

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:25.340
I won't wait

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:29.400
Even though you risked your life for me,

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:31.960
even though they were called your man,

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:34.710
I can't

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:47.440
I'm scared every time we see each other

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:52.190
I know that I have feelings for someone else

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:56.840
So why can't I let you go and start ignoring you?

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:21.850
Hae Soo

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:34.690
Brother!

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:38.010
Sister has disappeared!

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:39.730
She is not in Damiwon

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:43.660
Was...she kicked out?

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:57.380
S... Su?

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:14.280
Su, no...

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:38.630
Su!!!

00:11:06.590 --> 00:11:11.060
Once upon a time there lived a troublesome man, but he lost his life

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:15.770
Is it your work?

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:18.930
I'm sure you wanted to get rid of him too.

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:26.000
I look at you and it seems to me that I gave birth to you

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:29.510
You and I will get along very well

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:32.670
This won't happen

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:36.690
I just remembered

00:11:37.270 --> 00:11:43.000
my mother was exiled for causing the emperor's concubine to miscarry

00:11:45.060 --> 00:11:47.490
She was a concubine O

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:53.670
It was you, Empress, who killed the woman,
whom His Majesty loved most

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:56.970
I can't get close to the one

00:11:56.970 --> 00:11:59.340
who can be kicked out at any time

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:06.630
You have to understand

00:12:07.710 --> 00:12:09.610
that we are in the same boat

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:12.840
I drank the poison myself, who will doubt me?

00:12:13.840 --> 00:12:17.740
The one who knew the truth and the one who helped me are already dead

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:20.770
Only you remain, Empress

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:30.890
Never make my mother kneel again.

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:36.380
Protect yourself properly

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:02.050
As expected, Yong Hwa is different

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:04.700
Do you understand why I like her?

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:06.030
She's dangerous

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:09.460
She has more ambition than any man

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:12.060
Stay away from her

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:14.100
It makes her funny

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:19.660
Have you met Uncle Wang Sik Ryeom?

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:25.250
Uncle agreed to support me when needed

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:31.010
You will soon become Empress Dowager

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:34.460
He won't help without getting something in return.

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:38.310
What?

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:42.810
Sogyeong will become the capital

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:45.320
*Now Pyongyang

00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:54.040
One year later (26th year of Taejo's reign)

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:13.470
Clans from rural settlements,
who have never visited the palace?

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:15.910
What happened?

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:18.450
Before his death, the emperor wants to give 10 instructions

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:21.960
Perhaps the throne will be taken not by the first son, but by the second

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:25.060
Many believe that the emperor will choose me

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:27.540
Nonsense

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:30.010
How are you doing?

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:32.900
I heard you got rid of the pirates

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:35.310
Why didn't you visit your mother?

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:36.770
She's offended

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:39.720
I'm fine, don't worry

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:42.430
She still has you

00:14:42.430 --> 00:14:44.140
Look how he spoke

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:48.320
Wow, he's changed since he became close to you.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:15:00.280
Now, if they want to achieve the throne,
let the brothers line up behind me

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:05.360
His Majesty pushed me into the tiger's mouth

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:09.980
The Emperor wants to give 10 instructions,
to find out who's on your side

00:15:10.530 --> 00:15:14.960
I'm afraid that my loved ones will suffer in the end.

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:44.810
I was wrong!

00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:49.100
Wrong again, well again

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:52.400
Why are you pointing with a dagger? You need to drive it slowly

00:15:52.400 --> 00:15:54.990
You're always wrong in the same place

00:15:54.990 --> 00:15:57.670
You will confuse people with your dance at a peace meeting

00:15:58.310 --> 00:16:00.190
- Let's try again
- I don't want to

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:01.200
What?

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:05.120
There is a limit to how much you can overload a person

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:08.110
Here, look, look

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:11.630
Do you see how swollen my lips were while I was helping you?

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.980
My wife has prepared food, she is waiting for me

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:22.070
I have to go

00:16:22.070 --> 00:16:23.330
Are you married?

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:27.470
And what?

00:16:28.860 --> 00:16:30.630
The concern is, am I married?

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:32.250
Why would...

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:34.590
What do I care?

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:40.870
How long have you... been married?

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:43.950
Do you have children?

00:16:46.340 --> 00:16:47.690
Let me think

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:52.510
20 years have already passed, there is a wonderful son

00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:55.780
- What?
- A wife is a wife

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:57.840
My father's wife

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:03.140
My mother is waiting, it's time for me to go

00:17:03.140 --> 00:17:06.480
Are you... kidding me? Lost your fear?

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:09.440
I fooled you, fooled you

00:17:14.280 --> 00:17:17.210
Practice is good, just don't get hurt

00:17:18.630 --> 00:17:19.830
Okay?

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:21.650
- Oh...
- Okay

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:29.820
Teachings of Mencius?

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:32.780
Are you checking on your husband now?

00:17:34.980 --> 00:17:38.580
Yes I'm ready to bet
my hand on the fact that I read all this

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:44.690
This is my hand

00:17:45.630 --> 00:17:46.890
Next!

00:17:49.280 --> 00:17:51.990
Take it! Take everything!

00:17:51.990 --> 00:17:55.430
My arms, legs, throat - take everything!

00:17:58.450 --> 00:17:59.650
Next

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:02.040
You can't pick up your fingers

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:04.150
They belong to Hae Soo

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:23.150
You're not crying, are you?

00:18:38.460 --> 00:18:39.770
Father!

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:47.210
Wow, my daughter is still alive and well.

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:52.020
Why do you look like a turd that someone chewed and threw away?

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:54.640
Why are you stuck on the table?

00:18:54.640 --> 00:18:57.510
What would you do if His Highness was scared to death?

00:18:58.020 --> 00:19:01.740
If he is afraid of this, then how can he live in this cruel world?

00:19:04.440 --> 00:19:07.560
Are you hurt? Should I blow on the wound?

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:20.730
When I take the throne,

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:23.230
I will divorce my wife and make you empress

00:19:25.170 --> 00:19:28.220
Your current wife is the daughter of Minister Park Young Gyu

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:32.060
You think I'll believe the lies that
that you will get rid of a close associate?

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:41.940
Park Young Gyu is from Hubaekje

00:19:41.940 --> 00:19:44.660
I need support to become a ruler

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:47.450
And then he will be a burden

00:19:57.580 --> 00:20:00.730
I can find weak points in people

00:20:01.460 --> 00:20:04.330
You can easily recognize the darkness

00:20:06.110 --> 00:20:10.190
Don't you think our marriage was made in Heaven?

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:29.730
You visit us often
I'm worried about what people will say

00:20:30.520 --> 00:20:34.540
Don't forget that you and I are complete opposites

00:20:35.340 --> 00:20:36.610
Don't worry

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:39.780
I came not to you, but to Yong Hwa

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:44.320
We have things to do because of the 10 instructions that our father left.

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:48.390
How about not waiting and going on the attack right now?

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:53.570
It will be problematic if the crown prince takes the throne

00:20:54.860 --> 00:20:57.540
Still, I won't be so immoral

00:20:57.540 --> 00:20:59.970
How can a child kill his own parent?

00:20:59.970 --> 00:21:02.410
Father is ready to kill his child

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:04.570
Why can't children?

00:21:11.690 --> 00:21:13.540
I'm kidding, I'm kidding

00:21:14.650 --> 00:21:17.640
Don't forget that you promised to support me, not the crown prince.

00:21:20.010 --> 00:21:21.150
Of course

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:35.720
I don't understand you brother

00:21:36.370 --> 00:21:38.640
Why don't you take the throne yourself?

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:41.000
Why be the shadow of the 3rd brother?

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:44.540
If we remove the crown prince now,

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:46.890
you can become a traitor even while sitting on the throne

00:21:47.930 --> 00:21:51.840
But the traitor who killed the traitor

00:21:52.720 --> 00:21:54.010
will become a hero

00:21:58.720 --> 00:22:01.140
Now it's much better to be Yo's shadow

00:22:01.140 --> 00:22:02.970
A very devoted shadow

00:22:04.240 --> 00:22:06.820
What if our 3rd brother betrays you?

00:22:07.890 --> 00:22:09.720
Will you help me

00:22:10.870 --> 00:22:11.880
What?

00:22:15.140 --> 00:22:16.420
This ring...

00:22:17.890 --> 00:22:19.710
suits you very well, Yong Hwa

00:22:24.290 --> 00:22:27.070
Are you asking me to become a hostage?

00:22:27.070 --> 00:22:29.060
Companion, assistant...

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:31.500
Use better words

00:22:32.120 --> 00:22:35.870
You owe me a lot, don't you?

00:22:37.320 --> 00:22:39.100
You'll have to take that risk

00:22:44.950 --> 00:22:47.610
I like the 8th prince the most

00:22:49.120 --> 00:22:54.810
It is said that the 14th Prince slit the throat of a pirate as if he were cutting a flower.

00:22:55.610 --> 00:22:59.390
The emperor made him emperor, favored him

00:22:59.390 --> 00:23:00.960
He can become a ruler

00:23:00.960 --> 00:23:02.190
Is it true?

00:23:03.260 --> 00:23:04.900
And the 8th prince?

00:23:04.900 --> 00:23:07.910
I heard that the Emperor was close to the 8th Prince

00:23:07.910 --> 00:23:12.860
They say daughters from many clans want to marry him

00:23:17.190 --> 00:23:21.650
Hae Soo, you were in Damiwon and saw the princes?

00:23:22.170 --> 00:23:23.580
Which one is better?

00:23:23.580 --> 00:23:25.190
Who's better, huh?

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:29.950
Hey, can't you hear me?

00:23:29.950 --> 00:23:31.930
Are you deaf?

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:34.310
It's better not to talk about princes

00:23:35.150 --> 00:23:36.990
Otherwise you might get into trouble

00:23:39.030 --> 00:23:42.640
So you're telling us not to even mention them?

00:23:43.750 --> 00:23:46.460
You were kicked out of there, why are you better than us?

00:23:47.930 --> 00:23:49.900
Just watch the words

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:52.350
God, God, God

00:23:52.870 --> 00:23:55.590
She won't let us talk about princes

00:23:55.610 --> 00:23:57.310
How funny

00:23:57.310 --> 00:24:02.680
No, I asked her to draw the face of the 4th prince, and she tore the paper

00:24:03.070 --> 00:24:07.050
Apparently we just need to rinse the laundry

00:24:07.050 --> 00:24:09.100
God, God

00:24:31.060 --> 00:24:33.430
Hey, what are you staring at?

00:24:33.900 --> 00:24:36.390
Who do you think you are? Small

00:24:39.230 --> 00:24:40.710
Stop it, I say

00:24:42.700 --> 00:24:46.430
You... I heard that because of you the eldest died

00:24:47.260 --> 00:24:50.870
I know that because of you, Concubine O from Damiwon died

00:24:50.870 --> 00:24:52.540
Unlucky girl

00:24:52.540 --> 00:24:56.670
Everyone says that you promise nothing but troubles

00:24:57.670 --> 00:24:59.080
Walking failure

00:25:19.250 --> 00:25:21.820
Feel good

00:25:21.820 --> 00:25:24.190
You should

00:25:28.520 --> 00:25:29.570
Brother!

00:25:32.730 --> 00:25:34.030
- Well done
- I'm so tired

00:25:35.340 --> 00:25:36.800
It was hard

00:25:45.840 --> 00:25:47.020
Brother!

00:25:51.640 --> 00:25:53.390
I didn't know about that road

00:25:53.390 --> 00:25:55.910
Did you want me to see her?

00:25:55.910 --> 00:25:58.190
A year has already passed

00:25:58.190 --> 00:26:00.460
Are you really going to leave it like this?

00:26:00.460 --> 00:26:01.730
She is a washerwoman from a gisaeng house

00:26:02.410 --> 00:26:04.350
This is the lowest place in the palace

00:26:04.930 --> 00:26:06.310
What do I care?

00:26:11.190 --> 00:26:12.700
I know everything

00:26:13.750 --> 00:26:17.020
You loved your sister

00:26:21.840 --> 00:26:23.740
There's a reason, right?

00:26:23.740 --> 00:26:26.950
Otherwise you wouldn't behave this way

00:26:26.950 --> 00:26:28.730
I can't die

00:26:29.910 --> 00:26:31.910
It was the emperor who kicked Hae Soo out

00:26:31.910 --> 00:26:33.780
You can't go against the will of the emperor

00:26:36.530 --> 00:26:37.850
Be careful too

00:26:38.420 --> 00:26:43.110
Don't forget that just one mistake can get you kicked out of the palace.

00:27:48.680 --> 00:27:52.760
Does your leg still hurt?

00:27:54.290 --> 00:27:56.150
I heard Jeong sent you medicine

00:27:56.590 --> 00:28:00.320
Only when I work too long or am in the water

00:28:02.730 --> 00:28:04.030
I'm fine

00:28:05.880 --> 00:28:07.220
Upset with me?

00:28:09.770 --> 00:28:13.150
Do you hate... me?

00:28:20.570 --> 00:28:24.420
I couldn't promise you anything, that's why I didn't come

00:28:28.360 --> 00:28:30.140
Because he became so useless...

00:28:32.980 --> 00:28:34.950
Because I couldn't do anything for you...

00:28:39.520 --> 00:28:42.120
The Emperor was so angry over the death of his concubine Oh,

00:28:42.720 --> 00:28:45.100
that's why I couldn't bring you back

00:28:46.280 --> 00:28:48.190
I can't bring myself to ask for marriage

00:28:48.190 --> 00:28:49.880
Did you miss me?

00:28:56.170 --> 00:28:57.490
Just once?

00:28:59.850 --> 00:29:04.700
Have you ever missed... me?

00:29:10.500 --> 00:29:11.680
Every day

00:29:14.030 --> 00:29:15.710
I wanted to see you every minute

00:29:28.310 --> 00:29:29.840
That's all I need

00:29:33.290 --> 00:29:34.560
That's enough

00:29:39.620 --> 00:29:44.260
Now everything will be better

00:29:44.260 --> 00:29:47.890
So when I get more power...

00:29:47.890 --> 00:29:49.840
Don't stress yourself out because of me

00:29:51.530 --> 00:29:53.330
Don't put yourself in danger

00:29:59.600 --> 00:30:01.680
I've seen enough

00:30:05.700 --> 00:30:07.210
Please take care of yourself

00:30:11.190 --> 00:30:13.020
Don't make me feel more pathetic

00:30:54.620 --> 00:30:56.790
What is the situation in Hujin?

00:30:56.790 --> 00:31:00.860
Gaozu died, his nephew is in charge

00:31:01.690 --> 00:31:03.590
Looks like they'll have a war with the Khitans

00:31:03.590 --> 00:31:05.490
due to territorial dispute

00:31:05.830 --> 00:31:08.420
Everyone's fighting over the throne

00:31:08.420 --> 00:31:10.320
I don't think they will win

00:31:10.390 --> 00:31:13.980
This means that the Khitans are beginning to dominate

00:31:14.790 --> 00:31:17.510
I want you to visit the Khitans this time

00:31:17.510 --> 00:31:18.710
I don't want

00:31:20.420 --> 00:31:21.530
Don't you want to?

00:31:21.530 --> 00:31:23.840
You broke your promise when I left

00:31:24.770 --> 00:31:26.240
I won't carry out your order

00:31:26.240 --> 00:31:29.020
Do you still feel something for that girl?!

00:31:29.620 --> 00:31:31.430
The Emperor must be able to get rid of people

00:31:31.430 --> 00:31:33.330
for the benefit of the family and the nation!

00:31:33.330 --> 00:31:36.800
You should be grateful that I did this!

00:31:36.800 --> 00:31:40.190
I am not an emperor and I will not become one

00:31:41.550 --> 00:31:43.950
If you want to keep the crown prince as an ally,

00:31:45.000 --> 00:31:46.720
don't tie a noose around my neck

00:31:47.270 --> 00:31:50.870
I, too, will now live like a person

00:31:59.970 --> 00:32:01.310
You!

00:32:04.680 --> 00:32:05.860
Your Majesty

00:32:06.550 --> 00:32:11.060
Children think they grew up without anyone's help, that's why they behave this way.

00:32:12.230 --> 00:32:14.580
Don't worry so much about it

00:32:14.580 --> 00:32:16.170
Otherwise you'll get sick

00:32:20.190 --> 00:32:22.630
He should have come to me like this from the very beginning

00:32:24.200 --> 00:32:25.240
What?

00:32:25.240 --> 00:32:28.120
Now he can beat any opponent

00:32:29.370 --> 00:32:33.990
It must be at the same level as it was so that I can die in peace

00:32:36.160 --> 00:32:40.510
Your Majesty, your star is still shining brightly, why do you say that?

00:32:40.510 --> 00:32:46.050
There are things that Heaven knows better than you

00:32:47.710 --> 00:32:50.460
You must be ready

00:34:03.510 --> 00:34:05.970
You didn't listen to me

00:34:08.000 --> 00:34:10.010
I told you to stay in Damiwon

00:34:11.200 --> 00:34:15.850
You know, physical labor suits you better than being a court lady

00:34:27.140 --> 00:34:28.720
I miss you

00:34:35.030 --> 00:34:37.070
You shouldn't be here

00:34:39.150 --> 00:34:40.480
Pretend you didn't see me

00:35:02.760 --> 00:35:04.070
You are as always

00:35:05.760 --> 00:35:06.850
beautiful

00:35:07.050 --> 00:35:08.100
Why?

00:35:09.370 --> 00:35:11.200
Why did you close it again?

00:35:12.500 --> 00:35:15.270
Forgot how to do makeup?

00:35:15.270 --> 00:35:16.850
Has the scar become even more pronounced?

00:35:17.350 --> 00:35:19.700
You hated him so much, why did you again...

00:35:31.880 --> 00:35:33.840
I didn't take it off, so I didn't forget you

00:35:36.600 --> 00:35:39.580
I was determined to come back and see you

00:35:41.680 --> 00:35:45.070
Now I am not a court lady of Damiwon, but a washerwoman in the gisaeng house

00:35:46.430 --> 00:35:48.870
I'm not at the level to talk to you, Your Highness.

00:35:51.400 --> 00:35:53.420
You returned safe and sound

00:35:54.760 --> 00:35:56.630
And you know that I'm fine

00:35:59.080 --> 00:36:00.420
That's enough

00:36:10.540 --> 00:36:12.600
- Su
- Please leave

00:36:13.580 --> 00:36:16.130
This is not where you should be. Come with me

00:36:16.130 --> 00:36:17.870
I will find a way out of this situation

00:36:18.420 --> 00:36:20.680
Leave me alone!

00:36:21.970 --> 00:36:26.870
I'm here because I can either live or die.

00:36:26.870 --> 00:36:29.520
Concubine O, who died because of me,

00:36:29.520 --> 00:36:32.680
or a terrible life in the palace,
which waits at every corner

00:36:32.680 --> 00:36:36.560
I only forget about all this when I'm dead tired

00:36:38.100 --> 00:36:41.100
You must forget your affection for me

00:36:42.080 --> 00:36:45.430
I'll look after you like you did when you helped me

00:36:45.430 --> 00:36:48.430
I'll help you forget everything
without living such a hard life

00:36:48.430 --> 00:36:51.380
Please don't ruin yourself because of me

00:36:51.380 --> 00:36:53.830
Even if the person I most want to avoid is

00:36:55.020 --> 00:36:56.780
is it you, your highness?

00:36:59.010 --> 00:37:04.990
When I meet you, I remember everything I wish I could forget.

00:37:10.010 --> 00:37:11.510
Come back

00:37:13.010 --> 00:37:16.680
I'm fine. I can survive here

00:37:17.080 --> 00:37:18.540
Your Highness,

00:37:21.490 --> 00:37:23.450
please live in peace

00:37:23.450 --> 00:37:27.340
Don't hold grudges or hate. Forget everything

00:37:29.340 --> 00:37:30.980
Then no one will get hurt

00:38:12.610 --> 00:38:14.330
Don't worry about it

00:38:14.850 --> 00:38:17.210
I am well aware of my condition

00:38:38.280 --> 00:38:40.590
This is a new tea from Damiwon

00:38:40.590 --> 00:38:43.660
Nothing suits me, and I don’t want anything.

00:38:44.380 --> 00:38:46.970
The new court lady made a different combination

00:38:47.260 --> 00:38:49.260
At least inhale the aroma

00:39:07.660 --> 00:39:10.480
That girl made it?

00:39:12.350 --> 00:39:14.850
I just wanted to give you back your appetite

00:39:14.850 --> 00:39:16.430
Sorry, Your Majesty

00:39:18.410 --> 00:39:21.030
Bring her to me

00:39:42.410 --> 00:39:44.830
I want you to take me as your wife

00:39:48.490 --> 00:39:52.560
I probably heard you wrong

00:39:53.060 --> 00:39:54.860
What do I need to do?

00:39:56.930 --> 00:39:59.930
I was thinking about what kind of person I am

00:40:00.220 --> 00:40:01.580
Although I was born a princess,

00:40:01.580 --> 00:40:04.620
received the undeserved love of the emperor and brothers,

00:40:04.620 --> 00:40:06.420
I was always missing something

00:40:06.850 --> 00:40:09.960
I wasn't happy

00:40:10.530 --> 00:40:12.930
When my whole family was exiled, I finally understood

00:40:13.490 --> 00:40:16.130
I need power

00:40:16.330 --> 00:40:19.630
The only thing that can satisfy my hunger

00:40:21.570 --> 00:40:23.870
- this is the throne

00:40:27.310 --> 00:40:28.980
I'm not that kind of person

00:40:29.950 --> 00:40:34.280
I'm the opposite of what you want

00:40:34.580 --> 00:40:38.200
Yes, I know. So I stayed away

00:40:39.220 --> 00:40:40.330
However...

00:40:42.080 --> 00:40:44.260
there was something I didn't know

00:40:49.000 --> 00:40:52.590
I'm a girl too

00:40:56.280 --> 00:40:58.860
I've loved you for a long time

00:40:59.870 --> 00:41:03.040
I'm destined to be with you

00:41:17.610 --> 00:41:19.280
When I was a child

00:41:20.410 --> 00:41:22.960
someone said that I was born under the emperor's star

00:41:25.010 --> 00:41:28.560
That day I got this scar

00:41:31.010 --> 00:41:34.830
They didn't even consider me a prince

00:41:36.510 --> 00:41:41.530
Destined? I don't believe in fate

00:41:43.710 --> 00:41:47.730
Plus, I have someone in mind

00:41:52.710 --> 00:41:55.760
Hae Soo... right?

00:41:59.310 --> 00:42:03.080
She brings misfortune
she will interfere with your future

00:42:03.080 --> 00:42:07.660
Without Su there is no future for me

00:42:10.730 --> 00:42:14.730
I hope I explained everything clearly

00:42:16.360 --> 00:42:20.580
I'm nothing without her

00:43:04.310 --> 00:43:08.100
His appearance... my grandfather looked the same before he died

00:43:09.630 --> 00:43:12.260
I don't know what year Taejo died,

00:43:13.660 --> 00:43:15.540
but I'm sure he doesn't have much left

00:43:18.690 --> 00:43:21.650
You think I don't have much time left

00:43:30.330 --> 00:43:32.090
Where did you come from?

00:43:35.540 --> 00:43:39.520
After what happened with Concubine O
I decided to watch you

00:43:40.640 --> 00:43:43.820
Your childhood friends, relatives...

00:43:44.980 --> 00:43:48.340
I also asked each and everyone from Uka's house

00:43:53.320 --> 00:43:57.310
And I concluded one thing: suddenly you became a completely different person

00:43:57.800 --> 00:43:59.540
You were completely different before

00:44:04.010 --> 00:44:07.900
My gut tells me
that you are like Chi Mon

00:44:09.770 --> 00:44:12.410
You know something about the future that we don't know

00:44:18.210 --> 00:44:22.190
Do you know that my 4th son was born under a star, which promises him to become an emperor?

00:44:28.570 --> 00:44:33.370
To Crown Prince Mu and Prince So
both are destined to rule the country

00:44:33.810 --> 00:44:37.920
Nobody knows what will happen in the palace

00:44:42.300 --> 00:44:44.920
You'll be watching this

00:44:47.310 --> 00:44:50.690
Even so, you stay away from it

00:44:51.000 --> 00:44:56.090
Can't you just send me to hell?

00:44:57.720 --> 00:45:01.820
I'm no longer sure I can cope with life here.

00:45:01.820 --> 00:45:04.860
Don't pay attention to things
which you can't control

00:45:04.860 --> 00:45:07.670
If you can't keep quiet about what's happening here,

00:45:10.350 --> 00:45:13.470
you will be in the same situation no matter where you go

00:45:20.310 --> 00:45:24.610
Don't let your future regrets ruin what you have now.

00:45:29.210 --> 00:45:31.260
Sooyoung called you her daughter

00:45:32.090 --> 00:45:35.620
This means that you are my daughter too, that’s why I’m giving you this advice.

00:46:37.110 --> 00:46:38.460
Are you okay?

00:46:39.460 --> 00:46:40.460
- Show me
- Everything is fine

00:46:40.460 --> 00:46:41.700
It's okay

00:46:41.700 --> 00:46:44.070
Like nothing? What time is this already?

00:46:44.700 --> 00:46:45.700
Let me see

00:46:59.990 --> 00:47:01.370
What happened?

00:47:03.940 --> 00:47:05.430
I shouldn't ask, right?

00:47:12.250 --> 00:47:13.680
What if I hug you?

00:47:16.050 --> 00:47:17.190
Can I do this?

00:47:26.080 --> 00:47:31.330
Sorry I wasn't there
when you had a hard time

00:47:32.620 --> 00:47:33.960
This was before I met you

00:47:33.960 --> 00:47:35.370
This makes me feel even more guilty

00:47:37.000 --> 00:47:39.210
This bothers me more than anything else

00:47:40.990 --> 00:47:42.670
That I didn't know you then

00:47:44.570 --> 00:47:48.250
I only want one thing - for you to be happy now

00:47:51.130 --> 00:47:52.280
Trust me

00:47:56.380 --> 00:47:58.040
Who are you to trust you?

00:47:58.950 --> 00:48:01.230
I never had high hopes for you

00:48:05.030 --> 00:48:06.110
Woo Hee

00:48:09.470 --> 00:48:11.320
I still have something to confess to you

00:48:30.910 --> 00:48:32.870
Are you upset about something?

00:48:33.620 --> 00:48:35.430
Why such a sad look?

00:48:38.300 --> 00:48:42.070
Maybe... something happened to Baek Ah?

00:48:44.000 --> 00:48:46.240
How did you say you met him?

00:48:50.480 --> 00:48:54.530
This was before I got to the palace. We met in a shop

00:48:54.530 --> 00:48:58.130
He also knew my cousin, that's how

00:48:59.180 --> 00:49:01.020
He looks like a good man

00:49:02.270 --> 00:49:04.440
I can guarantee it

00:49:05.290 --> 00:49:07.190
If it was the old me...

00:49:08.890 --> 00:49:11.110
I would never have met him

00:49:12.750 --> 00:49:17.040
But now that I'm a gisaeng, we've met

00:49:19.360 --> 00:49:22.210
I can't tell you everything

00:49:22.210 --> 00:49:26.570
But he only comes here because of you

00:49:27.500 --> 00:49:29.240
So don't push him away

00:49:29.240 --> 00:49:30.320
No

00:49:32.260 --> 00:49:34.750
We shouldn't get close

00:49:36.400 --> 00:49:37.560
Coming soon

00:49:39.400 --> 00:49:40.560
I'll leave

00:49:41.230 --> 00:49:43.830
Will you leave? Where?

00:49:44.970 --> 00:49:46.830
Do you remember when we first met?

00:49:48.030 --> 00:49:50.750
We became friends because we both went through similar struggles.

00:49:51.550 --> 00:49:53.880
Why did we go through this?

00:49:55.050 --> 00:49:56.720
We didn't ask each other

00:49:58.530 --> 00:50:00.090
Let's continue to do this in the future

00:50:01.430 --> 00:50:03.210
It's best not to know

00:50:03.880 --> 00:50:08.300
Then, if something happens, you won't find yourself in a difficult situation.

00:50:11.690 --> 00:50:13.360
Peace meeting tomorrow

00:50:14.590 --> 00:50:16.280
You'll help me look good, okay?

00:50:17.530 --> 00:50:18.980
Yes, of course

00:50:19.880 --> 00:50:22.630
You will be the most beautiful girl from the gisaeng house

00:50:22.630 --> 00:50:24.720
I want you to see me one day

00:50:26.670 --> 00:50:28.560
they could never forget me

00:50:30.860 --> 00:50:32.500
Make me like this

00:50:39.110 --> 00:50:40.640
That's how I want to be remembered

00:50:52.010 --> 00:50:55.650
That girl... is ready yet?

00:50:55.650 --> 00:50:58.290
A peaceful meeting would be an ideal opportunity

00:50:58.290 --> 00:51:01.100
She's full of hatred for the emperor

00:51:01.660 --> 00:51:02.970
Don't worry

00:51:02.970 --> 00:51:05.130
This must remain a secret from my mother.

00:51:05.700 --> 00:51:09.910
As much as she hates the emperor, she loves him

00:51:16.210 --> 00:51:18.570
You need to cancel your attendance at the peace meeting

00:51:18.570 --> 00:51:20.570
You look really bad

00:51:21.350 --> 00:51:23.130
I think so too

00:51:23.130 --> 00:51:26.210
You don't usually attend peace meetings

00:51:26.210 --> 00:51:29.130
You decided to take part,
because clan representatives will arrive

00:51:29.130 --> 00:51:31.680
My uncle Wang Sik Ryeom will be there

00:51:32.210 --> 00:51:35.760
I can take care of him.
You better get some rest

00:51:41.510 --> 00:51:43.560
I think it would be best to show up there

00:51:44.420 --> 00:51:48.750
The purpose of your appearance is
to show how healthy you are

00:51:50.180 --> 00:51:53.290
You should at least stay there for a while
to stop the rumors

00:51:55.040 --> 00:51:56.800
You're right

00:51:58.270 --> 00:52:01.130
I can't give them something to gossip about

00:52:06.510 --> 00:52:07.820
Let's go

00:53:24.610 --> 00:53:25.770
Su

00:53:34.360 --> 00:53:37.360
Let's get married

00:53:38.840 --> 00:53:39.910
What?

00:53:39.920 --> 00:53:43.270
If we get married, you can leave the gisaeng house and palace

00:53:43.270 --> 00:53:44.510
Let's do this

00:53:46.610 --> 00:53:48.110
I can't

00:53:53.620 --> 00:53:57.280
If you don't like me that much, we can get a divorce when we leave the palace.

00:53:57.840 --> 00:54:00.860
I'll do this for you. So let's leave

00:54:02.260 --> 00:54:04.470
You have a lot of work to do, prince

00:54:05.550 --> 00:54:07.490
You don't have to leave because of me

00:54:10.840 --> 00:54:12.330
Besides, the Emperor...

00:54:15.060 --> 00:54:17.790
he worries and thinks a lot about you

00:54:17.790 --> 00:54:19.810
He constantly tests his children

00:54:20.650 --> 00:54:22.340
First he is an emperor, and only then a father

00:54:23.340 --> 00:54:24.980
I don't want to be near him

00:54:31.960 --> 00:54:33.210
What if...

00:54:36.820 --> 00:54:38.520
will you become emperor?

00:54:40.800 --> 00:54:42.770
Will you leave?

00:54:45.630 --> 00:54:49.790
If I become emperor, will you go with me?

00:54:52.340 --> 00:54:54.410
It was hard to travel as an ambassador

00:54:54.970 --> 00:54:56.540
I often felt free

00:54:57.550 --> 00:54:59.050
Every minute I thought about you

00:55:01.090 --> 00:55:03.110
I wanted you to feel this freedom too

00:55:04.700 --> 00:55:08.360
I want to live peacefully with you
and so that no one touches us

00:55:09.500 --> 00:55:10.790
If this doesn't happen...

00:55:11.690 --> 00:55:15.500
I don't care who I will be -
the emperor or someone else

00:55:28.980 --> 00:55:30.200
Come with me

00:55:34.300 --> 00:55:36.230
You're my man

00:55:44.610 --> 00:55:45.610
No

00:55:47.200 --> 00:55:51.240
I cannot marry you and leave the palace, your highness

00:55:59.850 --> 00:56:00.980
Su!

00:56:07.650 --> 00:56:09.750
Will the prince marry the washerwoman?

00:56:12.940 --> 00:56:15.080
Don't try to control Hae Soo
with this lie

00:56:15.080 --> 00:56:17.260
If I said I'm getting married, then I'm getting married

00:56:20.450 --> 00:56:22.200
She was in danger

00:56:25.410 --> 00:56:26.660
because of you

00:56:28.790 --> 00:56:33.490
All because she got caught up in your quarrel with Empress Yu.

00:56:34.770 --> 00:56:36.250
You started it

00:56:38.580 --> 00:56:40.290
And now you want to marry her?

00:56:42.980 --> 00:56:44.860
I can't forgive you

00:56:44.860 --> 00:56:46.260
I feel the same

00:56:48.210 --> 00:56:51.290
I gave you everything you needed to prove Hae Soo's innocence

00:56:52.080 --> 00:56:54.000
But in the end you couldn't do it

00:56:56.420 --> 00:56:58.400
Your uselessness has me shaking with anger

00:56:59.150 --> 00:57:00.450
You!

00:58:27.360 --> 00:58:28.680
I was wrong!

00:58:28.680 --> 00:58:31.860
Why are you pointing with a dagger? You need to drive it slowly

00:59:19.800 --> 00:59:21.810
Stop pretending you care about her

00:59:21.810 --> 00:59:23.920
and turn away from her as before

00:59:24.900 --> 00:59:27.100
You are no longer related to her

00:59:27.100 --> 00:59:28.930
She has nothing to do with you

00:59:47.850 --> 00:59:54.410
Thanks for watching with us!
Release group MANIA

00:59:47.850 --> 00:59:54.410
